# Line endings are LF in the repository. Without this, a Windows checkout with
# core.autocrlf=true converts them to CRLF in the working tree, and Prettier —
# which defaults to endOfLine "lf" — then reports almost every file as badly
# formatted. `npm run format:check` failed on 35 untouched files for that reason
# alone, which made the formatter's verdict impossible to trust locally.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary, so Git never tries to normalise or diff them as text.
*.jpg binary
*.png binary
*.svg text eol=lf
*.ico binary
